name: Steel Joker — steel-card mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Steel Joker gives X0.2 Mult for each Steel card in the full deck. Lua `enhancement_gate`
  means real shops require a Steel card in deck before it can appear; Motely can still search
  the raw first-shop slot. RAG aliases: steel card X-mult, Chariot enabler, DNA steel clone,
  held-in-hand steel build.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: SteelJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - tarotCard: TheChariot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: DNA
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
    label: "DNA (duplicates a Steel card to grow count)"
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Splash
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
